    <item>
      <title>Snirozu/Funkin-Psych-Online</title>
      <link>https://github.com/Snirozu/Funkin-Psych-Online</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Friday Night Funkin&#39; Mod that utilizes Online Features&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;link&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://funkin.sniro.boo&quot;&gt;https://funkin.sniro.boo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt; &lt;img width=&quot;200&quot; src=&quot;https://github.com/Snirozu/Funkin-Online-Server/raw/main/client/public/images/transwag.png?raw=true&quot; /&gt; &lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Online Multiplayer (Public and LAN)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;2v2 PvP&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Built-In Mod Downloader&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;No Port Forwarding needed&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Game Modifiers&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Custom API&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Skins Support&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Leaderboards&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Erect/Nightmare Difficulty Support&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Multi-Key Support&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
